    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">MIND works entirely on your device.\n\n• All your data (habits, sleep, nutrition, journal...) is stored locally on your phone only.\n• Your data stays local and is sent to a server only if you sign in and choose to upload it to your cloud account. We use no trackers or ads; the internet is also used to download a fresh quote.\n• Permissions requested: notifications (for reminders) and physical activity (for step counting) only.\n• You can export or delete your data at any time, and uninstalling the app removes everything.\n\nIf you have questions, contact us through the app page.</string>
